  <name>Hue</name>
  <summary>Draw and edit raster images</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Hue is a straightforward raster paint application for the GNOME desktop, in the
      spirit of the classic Paint. It gives you the core drawing tools and gets out of
      the way.
    </p>
    <p>Tools included:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Pencil, brush and eraser</li>
      <li>Line, rectangle and ellipse, filled or outlined</li>
      <li>Flood fill and colour picker</li>
      <li>Undo and redo history</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Hue works entirely offline: it never connects to the network and keeps every
      image on your own machine.
    </p>
  </description>
  <developer id="io.github.rafa">
    <name>Hue contributors</name>
  </developer>
